{
  "uid": "tributary-running-footpath",
  "title": "Running footpath",
  "description": "The path of each foot through a stride, from a Stryd Duo's Footpath (the Stryd connector: footpath_loop, footpath_step): a run's typical stride seen from the side, from behind and from above, compared with another run, and the shape of the stride over time at the same pace.",
